                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="439 2035 439 2050 2208 2041 2211 2026 2206 1998 1912 1985 1910 1985 1845 1996 1816 1985 1814 1985 1812 1985 1810 1985 1808 1985 1790 1998 1632 1998 1598 1987 1596 1987 1593 1987 1591 1987 1589 1987 1574 2000 1392 2000 1355 1987 1353 1987 1351 1987 1349 1987 1301 2000 985 1989 983 1989 870 2002 714 1991 712 1991 547 2002 508 1991 506 1991 504 1991 437 2004 439 2035"/>
                        </Shape>
